          "tags": "Cinematic Instagram Reel, lonely person walking through a rainy city at night, neon reflections, emotional eyes, fake smile fading in a mirror, dreamy moody atmosphere, slow motion, film grain, soft bokeh, raw heartbreak aesthetic, viral Gen-Z music video, 9:16 vertical, instantly captivating.",
          "prompt": "PRETEND\n\nAll i is to do pretend\nthat I dont care anyone\ncause thats the way I can live a run\n\ndays of love in these confused feelings\nmade up lies, I'm allowed to do sin\nbut I dont oh I don't cause I don't\ndon't pretend to be alright\ninfront of everyone\ncause it drains all the mood\nthat I'm having all alone\n\ndon't pretend to be everyone's favorite\nploting twists in stories\noh that's no my job\nholding to good hiding so good\nAnd maybe I'm tired of running away\nfrom all of the things I don't know how to say\nI smile when they look, then I fade when they're gone\npretending I'm right when I know that I'm wrong\n\n[Chorus]\nOh, I don't wanna pretend anymore\nI don't wanna hide what I'm feeling inside\nI've been closing every door\njust to keep the pieces of me alive\nIf I cry, let me cry\nif I fall, let me fall\nI don't need to be somebody's favorite at all\nOh, maybe someday I'll learn\nI don't have to pretend to be someone I’m not\n\n[Verse 2]\nI keep my secrets underneath my skin\nwhere nobody knows where the hurt begins\nI laugh at the jokes, I play along\nthen I go home and wonder where I belong\n\nEverybody wants a perfect face\na perfect heart in a perfect place\nbut I'm just trying to breathe tonight\nwithout turning all my wrongs into right\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nAnd maybe I'm scared of being seen\nof letting somebody know what I really mean\nSo I paint my smile and I carry on\nbut the colors disappear when everyone is gone\n\n[Chorus]\nOh, I don't wanna pretend anymore\nI don't wanna hide what I'm feeling inside\nI've been closing every door\njust to keep the pieces of me alive\nIf I cry, let me cry\nif I fall, let me fall\nI don't need to be somebody's favorite at all\nOh, maybe someday I'll learn\nI don't have to pretend to be someone I’m not\n\n[Bridge]\nMaybe I'm not broken\nmaybe I'm just tired\nmaybe all these feelings\nare the things that make me human\n\nAnd if I lose somebody\nfor showing who I am\nthen maybe they were never meant\nto understand\n\n[Breakdown]\noh oh oh uh uh uh\noh oh oh uh uh uh\ncause I do pretend to pretend i pretend\n\noh oh oh uh uh uh\noh oh oh uh uh uh\nbut underneath it all\nI'm still trying to understand\n\n[Final Chorus]\nI don't wanna pretend anymore\nlet the whole world see me as I am\nI don't wanna smile just to hide the storm\nI don't wanna live inside somebody else's plan\n\nIf I cry, let me cry\nif I fall, let me fall\nI don't need to be everyone's favorite at all\nAnd if tomorrow comes\nI'll face it on my own\nmaybe I was never meant\nto feel at home in everyone\n\n[Outro]\nAll i is to do pretend\nthat I dont care anyone\ncause thats the way I can live a run\n\nBut maybe I don't have to run\nmaybe I don't have to hide\nmaybe I can let myself\nfeel everything inside\n\noh oh oh uh uh uh\noh oh oh uh uh uh\ncause I do pretend to pretend i pretend\n\nbut tonight...\nI don't wanna pretend.",
