          "prompt": "A ROOM WITH THREE MIRRORS\n\n\n\nA room with three mirrors\nTwo that reflect\nOne that reminds you\nOf your own transparency\n\nSubstance is what we crave\nOr claim as such\nWe want the canvas\nPainted\nThe atmosphere\nAlive\n\nBut what we learn\nFrom the start\nIs that part of desire\nNever satisfied\n\nWhat we feel\nIs the effect\nOf flesh and flood\nThe sinful snide\nOur guiltiness wears\n\nRetribution\nFor what?\nNo answer\n\nStop expecting God\nTo apologize\nHis greatest weakness\nIs his inability\nTo communicate\n\nSystems\nA row of yellow tulips\nBurning moist lips\nBeneath the sun\n\nLight consumes\nBurns\nFeeds\nAnd fails to reveal\nAnything oblique\n\nOnly enough time\nTo remember\nOur weakness\nAnd realize\nRecognition\nIs found only through flame\n\nLike revelation\nIts lessons finalize\nAnd fix the problem\nBy exterminating\nAll opposition\n\nThen, a child\nI learned\nMy seat in weather\n\nThe rain clearing\nThe stagnant stank\nOf quicker transportation\n\nWhisper your last words\nNow\nSo we know when\nTo cry\n\nSo we know\nWhen to cry\nWhen to cry\nWhen to cry\n\n\n\nA ROOM WITH THREE MIRRORS\n\nCopyright © 2025-2026 X3NDRAKAN\n//Ae Production Company\nAll Rights Reserved",
